[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 21541.67, "timestamp": "05:59:01", "text": "工作，对吧？很抱歉耽误了你的时间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21543.91, "timestamp": "05:59:03", "text": "这么久了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21546.708, "timestamp": "05:59:06", "text": "不，没关系。这很有趣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21549.83, "timestamp": "05:59:09", "text": "和你聊天感觉时间过得飞快。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21552.31, "timestamp": "05:59:12", "text": "时光飞逝。是的。我们最初"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21556.15, "timestamp": "05:59:16", "text": "原本只有一小时，现在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21560.03, "timestamp": "05:59:20", "text": "我们奇迹般地得到了不止一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21563.23, "timestamp": "05:59:23", "text": "小时。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21566.708, "timestamp": "05:59:26", "text": "虽然有点小问题，但一切都好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21570.31, "timestamp": "05:59:30", "text": "是的。所以，我很抱歉，我一直……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21573.11, "timestamp": "05:59:33", "text": "开启喋喋不休模式。哦，那很好。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21575.51, "timestamp": "05:59:35", "text": "好的。我跟你唠叨了很多。那就是我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21579.59, "timestamp": "05:59:39", "text": "很高兴我们进行了一次愉快的谈话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21583.83, "timestamp": "05:59:43", "text": "是啊，我也很高兴。所以，这就是全部了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21585.67, "timestamp": "05:59:45", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21587.59, "timestamp": "05:59:47", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21589.83, "timestamp": "05:59:49", "text": "而你，就是那个说这话的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21592.31, "timestamp": "05:59:52", "text": "顺便说一句，我不太擅长说话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21594.39, "timestamp": "05:59:54", "text": "看看你现在的样子。你擅长"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21597.19, "timestamp": "05:59:57", "text": "说。"}]